<h1>Tax sales by state</h1>
<p class="lede">Whether a state sells tax liens or tax deeds changes everything about how you bid and get paid. Start with your state.</p>
<div class="grid">
{% for st in states %}
  <a class="card" href="{{ st.url }}">
    <h3>{{ st.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ st.sale_type | capitalize }} state · {{ st.placesText }}{% if st.counties.length %} · {{ st.upcomingCount }} dated sales{% endif %}</p>
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<p class="muted">More states are being added. Want yours sooner? Tell us when you sign up.</p>
